      "quote": "Prior treatment with other systemic immune-modulating agents that was less than 4 weeks (28 days) of the enrollment date, or associated with imAEs of any grade within 90 days prior to enrollment, or associated with toxicity that resulted in discontinuation of the immune-modulating agent.",
